    {
      "id": "advanced-grammar-topics",
      "title": "Advanced Grammar Topics",
      "icon": "🎓",
      "teaching": [
        {
          "h": "虽然...但是 (although...but)",
          "p": "Connects a contrasting idea across two clauses.",
          "ex": "虽然很累，但是我很开心。(Although tired, I'm happy.)",
          "audioId": "unit15-ex1"
        },
        {
          "h": "因为...所以 (because...so)",
          "p": "Connects a cause to its result.",
          "ex": "因为下雨，所以我没去。(Because it rained, I didn't go.)",
          "audioId": "unit15-ex2"
        },
        {
          "h": "不但...而且 (not only...but also)",
          "p": "Adds emphasis by connecting two related, escalating points.",
          "ex": "她不但聪明，而且勤奋。(She's not only smart, but also hardworking.)",
          "audioId": "unit15-ex3"
        },
        {
          "h": "一边...一边 (doing two things at once)",
          "p": "Describes two simultaneous actions.",
          "ex": "他一边吃饭一边看电视。(He eats while watching TV.)",
          "audioId": "unit15-ex4"
        }
      ],
      "quiz": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "q": "虽然很累，___我很开心。(but)",
          "answer": "但是",
          "audioId": "unit15-q1"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "因为...所以 connects:",
          "options": ["a cause to its result", "two contrasting ideas"],
          "answer": "a cause to its result",
          "audioId": "unit15-q2"
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "q": "她___聪明，而且勤奋。(not only)",
          "answer": "不但",
          "audioId": "unit15-q3"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "一边...一边 describes:",
          "options": ["two simultaneous actions", "a sequence of actions"],
          "answer": "two simultaneous actions",
          "audioId": "unit15-q4"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "不但...而且 is used to:",
          "options": [
            "add emphasis to two related points",
            "show a simple contrast"
          ],
          "answer": "add emphasis to two related points",
          "audioId": "unit15-q5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transitional-devices",
      "title": "Transitional Devices (关联词)",
      "icon": "🔗",
      "teaching": [
        {
          "h": "What 关联词 do",
          "p": "Words connecting ideas smoothly between clauses and sentences.",
          "ex": "然而, 因此, 此外, 例如",
          "audioId": "unit16-ex1"
        },
        {
          "h": "Showing contrast",
          "p": "然而 (however) signals a contrasting idea, more formal than 但是.",
          "ex": "他很努力。然而，他没有成功。",
          "audioId": "unit16-ex2"
        },
        {
          "h": "Showing cause and result",
          "p": "因此 (therefore) connects a cause to its effect, common in writing.",
          "ex": "下雨了，因此比赛取消了。",
          "audioId": "unit16-ex3"
        },
        {
          "h": "Adding ideas",
          "p": "此外 (furthermore) and 而且 (moreover) add another related point.",
          "ex": "她很聪明，此外还很努力。",
          "audioId": "unit16-ex4"
        }
      ],
      "quiz": [
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "Which word signals contrast?",
          "options": ["然而", "因此", "此外"],
          "answer": "然而",
          "audioId": "unit16-q1"
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "q": "下雨了，___比赛取消了。(therefore)",
          "answer": "因此",
          "audioId": "unit16-q2"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "此外 is used to:",
          "options": ["add another related idea", "show contrast"],
          "answer": "add another related idea",
          "audioId": "unit16-q3"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "例如 means:",
          "options": ["for example", "as a result"],
          "answer": "for example",
          "audioId": "unit16-q4"
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "q": "关联词 mainly help with:",
          "options": [
            "connecting ideas smoothly",
            "changing the topic entirely"
          ],
          "answer": "connecting ideas smoothly",
          "audioId": "unit16-q5"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
